continue processing while the server doesits processing in the
background. Processing the RequestWhen the request is sent to JSF, it
goes through the normal JSF life cycle processing steps. One of Sun's
crown development jewels, it provides a complete solution for
architecting and implementing larger scale projects, like your senior
project or getting your first job.<br>
